---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /index.html
canonicalPath: ""
seoTitle: "RaggieSoft Story Crossroads | Interactive Novels"
seoDescription: "Explore RaggieSoft Story Crossroads interactive novels with Rowan and Iris Hawthorne—featuring The Uncharted Waystation and Cedar Run."
---
{#
  ============================================================================
  src/site/index.njk — Imprint Home Page (`https://crossroads.raggiesoft.com/`)
  ============================================================================
  PLAIN-ENGLISH OVERVIEW:
    Welcomes visitors to the Lantern Signpost Conservatory alongside brother and
    sister Crossroads Architects Rowan & Iris Hawthorne, embeds our live Lit 3
    `<crossroads-live-sandbox>` Custom Element, and co-spotlights both
    *The Uncharted Waystation* and *Cedar Run*!
  ============================================================================
#}

<section class="cr-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div>
    <span class="cr-eyebrow">
      <span aria-hidden="true">🧭</span>
      <span>RaggieSoft Interactive Fiction Imprint</span>
    </span>
    <h1 id="hero-heading" class="cr-hero-title">
      Where Every Fork in the Trail Opens a Complete Story.
    </h1>
    <p class="cr-lead">
      Welcome to <strong>RaggieSoft Story Crossroads</strong>—tended by brother-and-sister Crossroads
      Architects <strong>Rowan &amp; Iris Hawthorne</strong>. Every option at a Crossroads leads into a
      rich, full-length literary route with zero trick endings or dead ends.
    </p>
    <div class="cr-actions">
      <a href="https://books.raggiesoft.com/waystation" class="cr-btn cr-btn-primary">
        <span aria-hidden="true">🔮</span>
        <span>Read The Uncharted Waystation</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://books.raggiesoft.com/cedar-run" class="cr-btn cr-btn-primary">
        <span aria-hidden="true">🌲</span>
        <span>Read Cedar Run</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#live-crossroads-preview" class="cr-btn cr-btn-secondary">
        <span aria-hidden="true">🧭</span>
        <span>Try Rowan’s Live Signpost</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/architects" class="cr-btn cr-btn-secondary">
        <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        <span>Meet Rowan &amp; Iris</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figure class="cr-hero-media">
    <img
      src="{{ imprint.heroImage }}"
      alt="Antique brass and deep teal compass beside an open journal and glowing lantern overlooking a twilight stone trail splitting into three lantern-lit paths toward a cedar creek, a starlit ridge beneath the Milky Way, and distant coastal lights"
      width="1200"
      height="675"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <figcaption class="cr-hero-caption">
      View from the Lantern Signpost Conservatory—three inviting trails, zero wrong answers.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="cr-section" aria-labelledby="hosts-heading">
  <div class="cr-book-showcase" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); align-items: center;">
    <figure class="cr-hero-media">
      <img
        src="{{ imprint.architectsImage }}"
        alt="Rowan Hawthorne with his brass compass and open trail map standing beside his sister Iris Hawthorne holding a leather-bound novel on the lantern-lit stone porch"
        width="1200"
        height="675"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption class="cr-hero-caption">
        Rowan &amp; Iris Hawthorne, your guides to every Story Crossroads signpost and medallion.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div>
      <span class="cr-eyebrow">
        <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        <span>Your Guides at the Signpost</span>
      </span>
      <h2 id="hosts-heading" class="cr-section-title">Built by Brother &amp; Sister Architects</h2>
      <p class="cr-card-body" style="margin-bottom: 0.9rem;">
        {{ imprint.architects.introQuote }}
      </p>
      <p class="cr-card-body" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        <strong>Rowan</strong> maps the diverging trails so every option leads to a true horizon, while
        <strong>Iris</strong> stamps the 2-Way and 3-Way Compass Medallions and keeps every route’s
        memory intact.
      </p>
      <div class="cr-actions">
        <a href="/architects" class="cr-btn cr-btn-secondary">Meet Rowan &amp; Iris →</a>
        <a href="/how-it-works" class="cr-btn cr-btn-secondary">How the Crossroads Works →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cr-section" aria-labelledby="pillars-heading">
  <div class="cr-section-header">
    <h2 id="pillars-heading" class="cr-section-title">The Story Crossroads Promise</h2>
    <p class="cr-card-body">
      Why Rowan and Iris built a dedicated home alongside Ocean View Archives specifically for branching novels.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="cr-grid-2">
    {% for pillar in imprint.pillars %}
    <article class="cr-card">
      <span class="cr-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ pillar.icon }}</span>
      <h3 class="cr-card-title">{{ pillar.title }}</h3>
      <p class="cr-card-body">{{ pillar.summary }}</p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="live-crossroads-preview" class="cr-section" aria-labelledby="preview-heading">
  <div class="cr-section-header">
    <span class="cr-eyebrow">
      <span aria-hidden="true">🧭</span>
      <span>Guided by Rowan &amp; Iris</span>
    </span>
    <h2 id="preview-heading" class="cr-section-title">Step Up to the Signpost</h2>
    <p class="cr-card-body">
      Rowan set three lanterns out on the evening trail so you can feel how a Story Crossroads works in
      real time—pick a 3-Way trail, follow it into a 2-Way Crossroads, and use Iris’s trail pills to
      step back anytime.
    </p>
  </div>

  <crossroads-live-sandbox></crossroads-live-sandbox>
</section>

<section class="cr-section" aria-labelledby="flagship-heading">
  <div class="cr-section-header">
    <span class="cr-eyebrow">
      <span aria-hidden="true">🧭</span>
      <span>Co-Featured 3-Way Editions</span>
    </span>
    <h2 id="flagship-heading" class="cr-section-title">Featured Editions: The Uncharted Waystation &amp; Cedar Run</h2>
  </div>

  {% for book in imprint.editions %}
  <article class="cr-book-showcase">
    <img
      src="{{ book.cover2x3 }}"
      alt="{{ book.title }} book cover featuring Iris’s circular 3-Way Story Crossroads medallion"
      width="260"
      height="390"
      loading="lazy"
      class="cr-book-cover"
    />
    <div>
      <span class="cr-eyebrow">{{ book.directionsLabel }} • {{ book.eraLabel }}</span>
      <h3 class="cr-section-title cr-mt-0">{{ book.title }} — {{ book.subtitle }}</h3>
      <p class="cr-card-body" style="margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">{{ book.synopsis }}</p>
      <p class="cr-card-body"><em>{{ book.architectNote }}</em></p>

      <ul class="cr-route-list" aria-label="Featured Story Crossroads routes in {{ book.title }}">
        {% for route in book.routes %}
        <li class="cr-route-item">
          <span class="cr-route-badge">{{ route.badge }}</span>
          <strong>{{ route.name }}</strong>
          <p class="cr-card-body">{{ route.summary }}</p>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>

      <div class="cr-actions">
        <a href="{{ book.readUrl }}" class="cr-btn cr-btn-primary">
          <span aria-hidden="true">📖</span>
          <span>Start Reading {{ book.title }}</span>
        </a>
        <a href="{{ book.worldUrl }}" class="cr-btn cr-btn-secondary">
          <span aria-hidden="true">{{ book.worldIcon }}</span>
          <span>{{ book.worldLabel }}</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
